<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<resources>
    <!--
      M5 — Next Transfer native launch field.

      `nt_native_blue` is the unavoidable Android launch surface's colour, and it
      is deliberately the FIRST STOP of the owner-approved intro splash's own
      backdrop (see `kIntroSplashEdgeColors.first` in lib/app/intro_splash.dart),
      i.e. the colour of the artwork's top edge: rgb(0, 56, 140).

      Using the artwork's own top colour means the platform launch field and the
      first Flutter frame are identical at the top of the screen, so the
      hand-over from the platform surface into the approved intro splash has no
      visible seam and no white/black frame is possible.

      Default and night intentionally resolve to the SAME value: launch branding
      must not shift with the device's Light/Dark setting.
    -->
    <color name="nt_native_blue">#FF00388C</color>
</resources>
